linaudit (0.2.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * APP-050/APP-051: detect Apache by its main config file (apache2.conf /
    httpd.conf) instead of the /etc/apache2 directory, which javascript-common
    creates on Debian without Apache installed (false positive).
  * FS-017: only list directories that are world-writable without the sticky
    bit; any directory with an orphan uid/gid was being reported (GitHub #4).
  * PER-013: exclude linaudit's own process (and its parent, matched by
    dev+inode) from the check (GitHub #10).
  * SEC-001/SEC-008: do not flag Lynis profile path rules as credentials
    (GitHub #9).
  * Refuse to write --output to anything other than a regular file
    (symlink, FIFO, device, directory) (GitHub #8).

 -- Alexia Michelle <alexia@lexiworks.dev>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:37:43 -0300

